rmine each branch’s setup.\n\nTop items\n\nNo paid items in this period.\n\nDevice health\nPOS_ADMIN\n\n1/1 online\n\nOnline requires a recent heartbeat. Registered devices are not assumed connected.\n\nAlerts\n\nNo device or stock alerts.\n\nRecent orders\nOrder\tBranch\tSource\tStatus\tPayment\tAmount\tBill\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nDisplay",
